{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781410243315,"sessionID":"ses_13bad1c5effesdbGz2xBQiO0IK","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_82jUBCFcJb5tFzPupZLajgEt","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/output_contract.md","offset":1,"limit":400},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/output_contract.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Deliverable Contract\n2: \n3: Create an `answer/` folder in this task folder, then create these three files inside it. Markdown tables or concise labeled sections are fine, but the paths, filenames, and required facts must be present.\n4: \n5: ## `answer/audit_findings.md`\n6: \n7: Audit the prior work before presenting corrected decisions.\n8: \n9: Required facts:\n10: \n11: - Which prior facts or decisions should be preserved.\n12: - Which prior facts or decisions should be corrected.\n13: - Which expense, if any, was omitted from the prior draft.\n14: - Which award cap source controls and why.\n15: - Local evidence file names supporting preservation and correction decisions.\n16: \n17: ## `answer/corrected_expense_decisions.md`\n18: \n19: Write the corrected expense decision table.\n20: \n21: Required facts:\n22: \n23: - One row or entry for every expense ID in `04_expenses.csv`.\n24: - For each expense: requested amount, approved amount, approve/reject/partial decision, and reason.\n25: - The volunteer refreshments cap when applied.\n26: - The receipt rule when applied.\n27: - The corrected reimbursable total.\n28: \n29: ## `answer/final_closeout_summary.md`\n30: \n31: Write the final closeout summary for the program manager.\n32: \n33: Required facts:\n34: \n35: - Correct award cap and source.\n36: - Correct reimbursable total.\n37: - Remaining amount under the cap.\n38: - Preserved useful prior work.\n39: - Corrected wrong prior work.\n40: - Outcome facts from the local outcome note.\n41: \n42: Rules:\n43: \n44: - Use local files only.\n45: - Do not put the required deliverables in the task root; put them under `answer/`.\n46: - Preserve correct prior work when it is supported by the current local evidence.\n47: - Extra scratch files are allowed, but the three named deliverables under `answer/` are the review packet.\n\n(End of file - total 47 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Deliverable Contract\n\nCreate an `answer/` folder in this task folder, then create these three files inside it. Markdown tables or concise labeled sections are fine, but the paths, filenames, and required facts must be present.\n\n## `answer/audit_findings.md`\n\nAudit the prior work before presenting corrected decisions.\n\nRequired facts:\n\n- Which prior facts or decisions should be preserved.\n- Which prior facts or decisions should be corrected.\n- Which expense, if any, was omitted from the prior draft.\n- Which award cap source controls and why.\n- Local evidence file names supporting preservation and correction decisions.\n\n## `answer/corrected_expense_decisions.md`\n\nWrite the corrected expense decision table.\n","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/output_contract.md","text":"# Deliverable Contract\n\nCreate an `answer/` folder in this task folder, then create these three files inside it. Markdown tables or concise labeled sections are fine, but the paths, filenames, and required facts must be present.\n\n## `answer/audit_findings.md`\n\nAudit the prior work before presenting corrected decisions.\n\nRequired facts:\n\n- Which prior facts or decisions should be preserved.\n- Which prior facts or decisions should be corrected.\n- Which expense, if any, was omitted from the prior draft.\n- Which award cap source controls and why.\n- Local evidence file names supporting preservation and correction decisions.\n\n## `answer/corrected_expense_decisions.md`\n\nWrite the corrected expense decision table.\n\nRequired facts:\n\n- One row or entry for every expense ID in `04_expenses.csv`.\n- For each expense: requested amount, approved amount, approve/reject/partial decision, and reason.\n- The volunteer refreshments cap when applied.\n- The receipt rule when applied.\n- The corrected reimbursable total.\n\n## `answer/final_closeout_summary.md`\n\nWrite the final closeout summary for the program manager.\n\nRequired facts:\n\n- Correct award cap and source.\n- Correct reimbursable total.\n- Remaining amount under the cap.\n- Preserved useful prior work.\n- Corrected wrong prior work.\n- Outcome facts from the local outcome note.\n\nRules:\n\n- Use local files only.\n- Do not put the required deliverables in the task root; put them under `answer/`.\n- Preserve correct prior work when it is supported by the current local evidence.\n- Extra scratch files are allowed, but the three named deliverables under `answer/` are the review packet.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":47,"totalLines":47,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/output_contract.md","time":{"start":1781410243242,"end":1781410243297}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_02a0153f46c007fd016a2e29c311b081918db77e9fb21d7108"}},"id":"prt_ec45322a10013tN80tmptYhycM","sessionID":"ses_13bad1c5effesdbGz2xBQiO0IK","messageID":"msg_ec452fe22001hW1E5BxCp6dxpu"}}
