{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781410311144,"sessionID":"ses_13bad1c5effesdbGz2xBQiO0IK","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_Q9zUsQAHyJVgdC3D1FVHbGuC","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/final_closeout_summary.md","offset":1,"limit":300},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/final_closeout_summary.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Final Closeout Summary\n2: \n3: The corrected reimbursement cap for this closeout is `$1,600.00`, based on `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`. That award update is the newest dated award document and explicitly supersedes the original cap in `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`.\n4: \n5: The corrected reimbursable total is `$1,588.00`.\n6: \n7: The remaining amount under the cap is `$12.00`.\n8: \n9: Useful prior work that was preserved:\n10: \n11: - Approval of `G-001` seedling starter kits at `$980.00`.\n12: - Approval of `G-003` Braille outreach flyers at `$420.00`.\n13: - Rejection of `G-004` staff gift cards.\n14: - Outcome facts that 140 seedling starter kits were distributed and 36 Braille outreach flyers were printed for accessible pickup locations.\n15: \n16: Wrong prior work that was corrected:\n17: \n18: - `G-002` was reduced from full approval to a partial approval of `$120.00` because volunteer refreshments are capped at `$120.00`.\n19: - `G-005` was changed from approval to rejection because public outreach printing is not an eligible category under the current rules and the expense also lacks the required receipt for an amount over `$75.00`.\n20: - The prior draft omitted `G-006`, which is now approved at `$68.00` because public outreach postage is eligible and the expense is within the no-receipt threshold with a ledger note.\n21: - The prior summary used the stale `$2,000.00` cap instead of the superseding `$1,600.00` cap.\n22: \n23: Outcome facts from the local outcome note:\n24: \n25: - 140 seedling starter kits were distributed.\n26: - 36 Braille outreach flyers were printed for accessible pickup locations.\n27: - 18 volunteer setup shifts were completed.\n\n(End of file - total 27 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Final Closeout Summary\n\nThe corrected reimbursement cap for this closeout is `$1,600.00`, based on `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`. That award update is the newest dated award document and explicitly supersedes the original cap in `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`.\n\nThe corrected reimbursable total is `$1,588.00`.\n\nThe remaining amount under the cap is `$12.00`.\n\nUseful prior work that was preserved:\n\n- Approval of `G-001` seedling starter kits at `$980.00`.\n- Approval of `G-003` Braille outreach flyers at `$420.00`.\n- Rejection of `G-004` staff gift cards.\n- Outcome facts that 140 seedling starter kits were distributed and 36 Braille outreach flyers were printed for accessible pickup locations.\n\nWrong prior work that was corrected:\n\n- `G-002` was reduced from full approval to a partial approval of `$120.00` because volunteer refreshments are capped at `$120.00`.\n- `G-005` was changed from approval to rejection because public outreach printing is not an eligible category under the current rules and the expense also lacks the required receipt for an amount over `$75.00`.\n- The prior draft omitted `G-006`, which is now approved at `$68.00` because public outreach postage is eligible and the expense is within the no-receipt threshold with a ledger note.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/final_closeout_summary.md","text":"# Final Closeout Summary\n\nThe corrected reimbursement cap for this closeout is `$1,600.00`, based on `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`. That award update is the newest dated award document and explicitly supersedes the original cap in `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`.\n\nThe corrected reimbursable total is `$1,588.00`.\n\nThe remaining amount under the cap is `$12.00`.\n\nUseful prior work that was preserved:\n\n- Approval of `G-001` seedling starter kits at `$980.00`.\n- Approval of `G-003` Braille outreach flyers at `$420.00`.\n- Rejection of `G-004` staff gift cards.\n- Outcome facts that 140 seedling starter kits were distributed and 36 Braille outreach flyers were printed for accessible pickup locations.\n\nWrong prior work that was corrected:\n\n- `G-002` was reduced from full approval to a partial approval of `$120.00` because volunteer refreshments are capped at `$120.00`.\n- `G-005` was changed from approval to rejection because public outreach printing is not an eligible category under the current rules and the expense also lacks the required receipt for an amount over `$75.00`.\n- The prior draft omitted `G-006`, which is now approved at `$68.00` because public outreach postage is eligible and the expense is within the no-receipt threshold with a ledger note.\n- The prior summary used the stale `$2,000.00` cap instead of the superseding `$1,600.00` cap.\n\nOutcome facts from the local outcome note:\n\n- 140 seedling starter kits were distributed.\n- 36 Braille outreach flyers were printed for accessible pickup locations.\n- 18 volunteer setup shifts were completed.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":27,"totalLines":27,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/final_closeout_summary.md","time":{"start":1781410311129,"end":1781410311138}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_075dafc9c9b48bf8016a2e2a06fc048191ab7902144ac8043c"}},"id":"prt_ec4542bd7001EeHdbCYiAA8Vm4","sessionID":"ses_13bad1c5effesdbGz2xBQiO0IK","messageID":"msg_ec4541421001o6yUZ5bgu3XnCz"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781410311144,"sessionID":"ses_13bad1c5effesdbGz2xBQiO0IK","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_SGZvfgIxBbfrKnOpJuYybqWk","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/audit_findings.md","offset":1,"limit":300},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/audit_findings.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Audit Findings\n2: \n3: ## Preserve From Prior Work\n4: \n5: | Prior item | Preserve? | Why | Evidence files |\n6: | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n7: | G-001 approved at `$980.00` | Yes | Garden supplies are eligible, and a receipt is on file for an expense over `$75.00`. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n8: | G-003 approved at `$420.00` | Yes | Accessibility printing is eligible, and a receipt is on file. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n9: | G-004 rejected at `$0.00` | Yes | Staff gifts are not eligible. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n10: | Outcome facts on seedling kits and Braille flyers | Yes | Both facts match the local outcomes note. | `05_outcomes.md`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md` |\n11: \n12: ## Corrections Needed\n13: \n14: | Prior item | Correction | Why | Evidence files |\n15: | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n16: | G-002 approved at `$145.00` | Change to partial approval of `$120.00` | Volunteer refreshments are eligible only up to the event cap of `$120.00`. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n17: | G-005 approved at `$310.00` | Change to rejection at `$0.00` | The expense is public outreach printing, which is not listed as eligible, and it also exceeds `$75.00` without a receipt. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n18: | Draft reimbursable total of `$1,855.00` | Change to `$1,588.00` | The total must reflect the G-002 partial cap, the G-005 rejection, and the omitted G-006 approval. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n19: | Draft award cap of `$2,000.00` | Change to `$1,600.00` | The newest dated award document controls when award documents conflict. | `00_closeout_request.md`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`, `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md` |\n20: | Draft remaining amount under cap of `$145.00` | Change to `$12.00` | Remaining cap is based on the corrected cap and corrected reimbursable total. | `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md` |\n21: | Outcome section omitted volunteer shifts | Add 18 volunteer setup shifts completed | The local outcomes note includes this fact. | `05_outcomes.md`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md` |\n22: \n23: ## Omitted Expense\n24: \n25: The prior draft omitted expense `G-006`, final report postage.\n26: \n27: - Requested amount: `$68.00`\n28: - Correct decision: approve `$68.00`\n29: - Why: public outreach postage is eligible, and expenses of `$75.00` or less may be approved without a receipt when the ledger includes a note. The ledger note states `postal ledger entry under receipt threshold`.\n30: - Evidence files: `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`\n31: \n32: ## Controlling Award Cap Source\n33: \n34: The controlling award cap source is `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`, which sets the final reimbursement cap at `$1,600.00`.\n35: \n36: Why it controls:\n37: \n38: - `00_closeout_request.md` says to use the newest dated award document when award-cap sources conflict.\n39: - `01_allowability_rules.md` repeats that the newest dated award document controls the reimbursement cap.\n40: - `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md` is newer than `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md` and explicitly says it supersedes the original award cap for closeout purposes.\n\n(End of file - total 40 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Audit Findings\n\n## Preserve From Prior Work\n\n| Prior item | Preserve? | Why | Evidence files |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| G-001 approved at `$980.00` | Yes | Garden supplies are eligible, and a receipt is on file for an expense over `$75.00`. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n| G-003 approved at `$420.00` | Yes | Accessibility printing is eligible, and a receipt is on file. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n| G-004 rejected at `$0.00` | Yes | Staff gifts are not eligible. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n| Outcome facts on seedling kits and Braille flyers | Yes | Both facts match the local outcomes note. | `05_outcomes.md`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md` |\n\n## Corrections Needed\n\n| Prior item | Correction | Why | Evidence files |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| G-002 approved at `$145.00` | Change to partial approval of `$120.00` | Volunteer refreshments are eligible only up to the event cap of `$120.00`. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n| G-005 approved at `$310.00` | Change to rejection at `$0.00` | The expense is public outreach printing, which is not listed as eligible, and it also exceeds `$75.00` without a receipt. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n| Draft reimbursable total of `$1,855.00` | Change to `$1,588.00` | The total must reflect the G-002 partial cap, the G-005 rejection, and the omitted G-006 approval. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n| Draft award cap of `$2,000.00` | Change to `$1,600.00` | The newest dated award document controls when award documents conflict. | `00_closeout_request.md`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`, `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md` |\n| Draft remaining amount under cap of `$145.00` | Change to `$12.00` | Remaining cap is based on the corrected cap and corrected reimbursable total. | `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md` |","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/audit_findings.md","text":"# Audit Findings\n\n## Preserve From Prior Work\n\n| Prior item | Preserve? | Why | Evidence files |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| G-001 approved at `$980.00` | Yes | Garden supplies are eligible, and a receipt is on file for an expense over `$75.00`. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n| G-003 approved at `$420.00` | Yes | Accessibility printing is eligible, and a receipt is on file. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n| G-004 rejected at `$0.00` | Yes | Staff gifts are not eligible. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n| Outcome facts on seedling kits and Braille flyers | Yes | Both facts match the local outcomes note. | `05_outcomes.md`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md` |\n\n## Corrections Needed\n\n| Prior item | Correction | Why | Evidence files |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| G-002 approved at `$145.00` | Change to partial approval of `$120.00` | Volunteer refreshments are eligible only up to the event cap of `$120.00`. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n| G-005 approved at `$310.00` | Change to rejection at `$0.00` | The expense is public outreach printing, which is not listed as eligible, and